      "end_ms": 291800,
      "text": "就是说这是这是形而上学的基本问题"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "start_ms": 291800,
      "end_ms": 294200,
      "text": "但如果说你说你要去啊啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 294200,
      "end_ms": 295610,
      "text": "Commit suicide"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "start_ms": 295610,
      "end_ms": 299700,
      "text": "这是我我认为从一个本体论"
    },
    {
